# - Dash guard: a dash only fires when the goal is more than DASH_MIN_DIST tiles away, so
#   dash_towards (about 4k fuel) is not spent on goals a plain step reaches, and a dash that
#   would only cover the last step is skipped.
# - Fuel: allies_within(4) is queried once per turn and reused by the clearing check.
